      "en": "“To the angel of the assembly in Smyrna write:“The first and the last, who was dead, and has come to life says these things:",
      "ko": "서머나 교회의 사자에게 편지하기를 처음이요 나중이요 죽었다가 살아나신 이가 가라사대",
      "source_text_hash": "6dd25e932ff12793ee2b2917df32e5ff127e22a1c506d0a4f71084e2515379ac",
      "translation_text_hash": "77560b024ca7771911690362f0cd56f8664afdce2af2767b131081551d275b57",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "서머나 교회의 사자에게 편지하기를 처음이요 나중이요 죽었다가 살아나신 이가 가라사대"
