        }
      ],
      "en": "“To the angel of the assembly in Pergamum write:“He who has the sharp two-edged sword says these things:",
      "ko": "버가모 교회의 사자에게 편지하기를 좌우에 날선 검을 가진 이가 가라사대",
      "source_text_hash": "77d07ce736615b41740f1ef2404ef7a406aa7488366b639fe2a9c63da3c08dc1",
      "translation_text_hash": "56f1eae96f6799b0e0d90c1a5acc51c68afab11b2a789f7a9226bcdd8efdf840",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
