      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "REV",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 25
        }
      ],
      "en": "Nevertheless, hold that which you have firmly until I come.",
      "ko": "다만 너희에게 있는 것을 내가 올 때까지 굳게 잡으라",
      "source_text_hash": "4d9f5c37aef8f0a9d395834492bfcc178c3b4a72cd0087f032018bc97509fda0",
      "translation_text_hash": "bbb3b62967f3326ec85de76d1974b5119f1b395967c4f2db0a286bc2fd259466",
